🎉 PHP 8.6.0 RC3 is available for testing!

This continues the PHP 8.6 release cycle, featuring:

- New namespaced Openssl\Session
- URI Builders fixes
- Io\Poll polling API fixes
- Compile-time array_map() optimization

… and more!

➕ Do: Test your projects!

➖ Don't: Run it in production. It's not fully ready yet.


